{
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "application_type": "Prior Approval",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The prior approval notification received 21/07/2025 is acknowledged. It is considered that the proposed erection of a 20m monopole supporting nine antennas and two dishes with wraparound cabinet at the base, together with six equipment cabinets and ancillary development, is contrary to the provisions of Schedule 2 Part 16 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (As Amended) as the siting and appearance of the proposal would significantly harm the character and appearance of the area and could pose a risk to pedestrian and highway safety. Therefore prior approval is required and hereby refused."
  ],
